{\rtf1\ansi\uc1\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Aptos;}}\f0\fs22
Y\u234?u c\u7847?u t\u7841?o OIDC client memoryos-test cho Mytasco\par
\par
M\u7909?c \u273?\u237?ch\par
MemoryOS d\u249?ng Keycloak l\u224?m OIDC broker cho \u273?\u259?ng nh\u7853?p Mytasco. Ng\u432?\u7901?i d\u249?ng ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \u273?\u259?ng nh\u7853?p b\u7857?ng c\u417? ch\u7871? Mytasco hi\u7879?n c\u243?, g\u7891?m OTP s\u7889? \u273?i\u7879?n tho\u7841?i; MemoryOS kh\u244?ng nh\u7853?n ho\u7863?c l\u432?u m\u7853?t kh\u7849?u/OTP.\par
\par
Th\u244?ng tin c\u7847?n cung c\u7845?p\par
- Realm/issuer URL Mytasco.\par
- OIDC Discovery URL: https://sso.<mytasco-domain>/realms/<mytasco-realm>/.well-known/openid-configuration\par
- client_id: memoryos-test.\par
- client_secret: g\u7917?i qua k\u234?nh qu\u7843?n l\u253? secret \u273?\u227? \u273?\u432?\u7907?c hai b\u234?n th\u7889?ng nh\u7845?t, kh\u244?ng g\u7917?i qua chat/email th\u432?\u7901?ng.\par
\par
C\u7845?u h\u236?nh client Mytasco\par
- Client type: Confidential.\par
- B\u7853?t Standard Flow / Authorization Code Flow.\par
- PKCE: S256.\par
- Kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n Client Credentials / Service Account.\par
- Kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n Web Origins/CORS cho broker callback.\par
- Alias broker t\u7841?i Keycloak MemoryOS: mytasco.\par
\par
Redirect URI \u273?\u259?ng nh\u7853?p\par
https://auth.kl3in.tech/realms/memoryos/broker/mytasco/endpoint\par
\par
Post-logout redirect URI\par
Discovery document n\u234?n c\u244?ng b\u7889? end_session_endpoint. N\u7871?u Mytasco Keycloak y\u234?u c\u7847?u \u273?\u259?ng k\u253? redirect URI khi logout, cho ph\u233?p:\par
https://auth.kl3in.tech/realms/memoryos/broker/mytasco/endpoint/logout_response\par
\par
Mytasco Keycloak c\u7847?n ch\u7845?p nh\u7853?n id_token_hint v\u224? post_logout_redirect_uri t\u7841?i logout endpoint.\par
\par
Scope v\u224? claim\par
Cho ph\u233?p scope: openid email profile.\par
\par
C\u7845?u h\u236?nh c\u225?c claim sau trong ID Token v\u224? UserInfo, kh\u244?ng ch\u7881? access token:\par
- sub: ID \u7893?n \u273?\u7883?nh, duy nh\u7845?t trong Realm; kh\u244?ng d\u249?ng s\u7889? \u273?i\u7879?n tho\u7841?i l\u224?m \u273?\u7883?nh danh c\u243? th\u7875? thay \u273?\u7893?i.\par
- email: email Mytasco hi\u7879?n h\u224?nh.\par
- email_verified: Boolean ph\u7843?n \u225?nh tr\u7841?ng th\u225?i x\u225?c th\u7921?c th\u7921?c t\u7871? c\u7911?a email.\par
- name: t\u234?n hi\u7875?n th\u7883? n\u7871?u c\u243?.\par
- given_name, family_name: optional; kh\u244?ng c\u243? th\u236? MemoryOS gi\u7919? tr\u7889?ng.\par
\par
V\u237? d\u7909? claim:\par
\{\par
  "sub": "stable-keycloak-user-id",\par
  "email": "hung@tasco.com.vn",\par
  "email_verified": true,\par
  "name": "Nguy\u7877?n V\u259?n H\u249?ng",\par
  "given_name": "H\u249?ng",\par
  "family_name": "Nguy\u7877?n"\par
\}\par
\par
Chu\u7849?n b\u7883? cho mapping Google Drive email kh\u225?c Mytasco email\par
N\u7871?u Mytasco qu\u7843?n l\u253? quan h\u7879? user v\u7899?i nhi\u7873?u Google Drive email, c\u243? th\u7875? chu\u7849?n b\u7883? claim \u273?a tr\u7883? \u273?\u227? x\u225?c th\u7921?c:\par
\{\par
  "drive_emails": ["hung@gmail.com", "hung@tasco.com"]\par
\}\par
MemoryOS hi\u7879?n ch\u432?a s\u7917? d\u7909?ng drive_emails; claim n\u224?y l\u224? \u273?\u7847?u v\u224?o cho h\u7841?ng m\u7909?c mapping Actor sang verified Drive emails sau n\u224?y. Kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n g\u7917?i groups, roles, department ho\u7863?c employee_code cho integration hi\u7879?n t\u7841?i.\par
\par
User test\par
- User A: email \u273?\u227? verified v\u224? c\u243? quy\u7873?n Google Drive tr\u234?n \u237?t nh\u7845?t m\u7897?t file/folder c\u7911?a Source Auto Sync.\par
- User B: email \u273?\u227? verified nh\u432?ng kh\u244?ng c\u243? quy\u7873?n tr\u234?n c\u225?c file/folder \u273?\u243?.\par
- N\u7871?u login d\u249?ng OTP s\u7889? \u273?i\u7879?n tho\u7841?i: vui l\u242?ng h\u432?\u7899?ng d\u7851?n test OTP ho\u7863?c c\u7845?p account test ph\u249? h\u7907?p.\par
\par
Kh\u244?ng y\u234?u c\u7847?u \u7903? giai \u273?o\u7841?n n\u224?y\par
- Kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n quy\u7873?n Admin Console Mytasco.\par
- Kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n danh s\u225?ch to\u224?n b\u7897? user Realm.\par
- Kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n Client Credentials cho chatbot theo user.\par
- Kh\u244?ng d\u249?ng access token Mytasco g\u7885?i th\u7859?ng API MemoryOS trong giai \u273?o\u7841?n broker login n\u224?y.
}